vlxblk8ei16.v  rd rs1 rs2 31..25=0x0A 14..12=0x5 6..2=0x0A 1..0=3

vlxblk12ei8.v  rd rs1 rs2 31..25=0x0B 14..12=0x0 6..2=0x0A 1..0=3
vlxblk12ei16.v rd rs1 rs2 31..25=0x0B 14..12=0x5 6..2=0x0A 1..0=3

